# The head of one whose hands gesture as it speaks (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/gesture-head.md): the hero with an
# own head says lines of his original voice to Xardas in the tower of the default save, close up, each take with one
# dialog gesture named by the bench (T_DIALOGGESTURE_03, 06, 08, 09: the ones that rocked the head most). The nod and
# the sway of the voice are off, so what moves the head here is the gesture alone. The line of g6 and g9 ends while the
# gesture plays: it is stopped half a second later (g6: the head tilted 30 degrees by the animation then). Then the same
# stop seen whole from the front (wide), and Xardas says a line with gesture 06 (npc: his trunk turns to the hero too).
# OPENGOTHIC_GESTURE_HEAD=0 films "было": the head goes with the gesture's animation, the gesture is cut in 0.3 s.
# No AI server. How to run it and measure the screen - scripts/bench/README.md, "Gesture head clip".
# @timeout 240
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean 30
overlay off
gestures param Nod 0
gestures param SwayYaw 0
gestures param SwayRoll 0
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 1500
gestures pick 3
rec g3
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
gestures pick 6
rec g6
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_AddonSuccess_15_00 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6200
stop
gestures pick 8
rec g8
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_15_01 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6500
stop
gestures pick 9
rec g9
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_AddonSuccess_15_00 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6200
stop
cam front 150 140
cam look 125
wait 800
gestures pick 6
rec wide
wait 700
speak player DIA_Addon_Xardas_AddonSuccess_15_00 NONE_100_XARDAS
wait 6200
stop
watch nearest
cam face 38 0 1
wait 1200
gestures pick 6
rec npc
wait 700
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
wait 9000
stop
gestures pick
